<title>USA: 30 people reported killed in air crash near Detroit.</title>
<headline>30 people reported killed in air crash near Detroit.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Comair commuter plane crashed on Thursday on approach to Detroit airport, killing all 30 people on board, the National Transportation Safety Board said.</p>
<p>It said the Embraer-120 plane crashed about 25 miles south of Detroit. A board offical said there were 25 passengers on board, two pilots and three flight attendants.</p>
